(COMMERCIAL READ) Tj
T*
(- Closed-loop intermediaries: likely ACV $250K-$750K; rough TAM $50M-$105M) Tj
T*
(- Employer-connected workforce intermediaries: likely ACV $200K-$500K; rough TAM $18M-$45M) Tj
T*
(- Community college pathways: likely ACV $150K-$350K; rough TAM $35M-$75M) Tj
T*
(- Large employers: likely ACV $500K-$1.5M+; rough TAM $750M-$2B) Tj
T*
(- Higher-ed with co-op / externship closure: likely ACV $200K-$500K; rough TAM $19M-$60M) Tj
T*
(- State workforce systems: likely ACV $500K-$1.5M+; rough TAM $38M-$60M) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The commercial picture reinforces the sequencing logic. The first lane does not need to be) Tj
T*
(the largest lane. It needs to be the one that best compounds into larger lanes later.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
